{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q410557","formula":"C₁₂H₃₀N₂²⁺","hill":"C12H30N2","elements":["H","C","N"],"composition":{"C":12.0,"H":30.0,"N":2.0},"names":{"en":"Hexamethonium","ru":"Гексаметония бензосульфонат"},"descriptions":{"en":"Hexamethonium is a non-depolarising ganglionic blocker, a neuronal nicotinic (nAChR) receptor antagonist that acts in autonomic ganglia by binding mostly in or on the nAChR receptor, and not the acetylcholine binding site itself. It does not have any effect on the muscarinic acetylcholine receptors (mAChR) located on target organs of the parasympathetic nervous system, nor on the nicotinic receptors at the skeletal neuromuscular junction, but acts as antagonist at the nicotinic acetylcholine receptors located in sympathetic and parasympathetic ganglia (nAChR).","ru":"Гексаметония бензосульфонат — лекарственное средство, ганглиоблокатор. Вместо дибензолсульфоната могут применяться и другие соли 1,6-бис-(N-триметиламмоний)-гексана. Дийодид выпускался под названием «Гексоний»."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":3604,"mass":202.38,"charge":2,"smiles":"C[N+](C)(C)CCCCCC[N+](C)(C)C","inchikey":"VZJFGSRCJCXDSG-UHFFFAOYSA-N","iupac":"trimethyl-[6-(trimethylazaniumyl)hexyl]azanium","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"3604","atoms":44,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-4.364,"y":-0.022,"z":-0.007,"el":"N"},{"x":4.364,"y":0.023,"z":-0.004,"el":"N"},{"x":-3.082,"y":-0.767,"z":0.014,"el":"C"},{"x":3.082,"y":0.766,"z":0.033,"el":"C"},{"x":-1.93,"y":0.226,"z":0.037,"el":"C"},{"x":1.93,"y":-0.227,"z":0.01,"el":"C"},{"x":-0.582,"y":-0.497,"z":0.013,"el":"C"},{"x":0.582,"y":0.495,"z":0.001,"el":"C"},{"x":-5.558,"y":-0.988,"z":0.002,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.484,"y":0.894,"z":1.219,"el":"C"},{"x":-4.469,"y":0.851,"z":-1.266,"el":"C"},{"x":5.557,"y":0.988,"z":0.0